# A3. CORE PRODUCT IDEA

The platform should solve two major problems.

## Seller problem

Many Pakistani makers currently depend on:

* Instagram
* Facebook
* TikTok
* WhatsApp
* DMs
* word of mouth

Their commerce workflow is fragmented.

They often have to manually manage:

* product presentation
* customer inquiries
* orders
* payments
* inventory
* delivery
* reviews
* marketing
* customer trust

DastKar should provide them with a structured digital storefront and marketplace.

## Buyer problem

Customers often struggle with:

* discovering genuine makers
* knowing whether a seller is trustworthy
* verifying product quality
* customization
* comparing products
* payment confidence
* delivery
* returns
* disputes

DastKar should make this experience structured and trustworthy.

