# A90. ERROR HANDLING

Every important operation needs graceful failure.

Examples:

Payment fails:

```text
Payment failed
→ Do not create duplicate order
→ Explain clearly
→ Allow retry
```

Inventory disappears:

```text
Checkout
→ inventory revalidation
→ explain unavailable item
→ allow cart update
```

Courier fails:

```text
Shipment failure
→ retry/manual operations
→ notify relevant team
```

AI fails:

```text
AI failure
→ seller can continue manually
```

